    "sections": {
        "description": "Empowerment is a lightweight and customizable WordPress theme designed for bloggers, coaches, consultants, speakers, trainers, mentors, and small businesses. The theme features responsive layouts, custom logos, custom menus, featured images, widget areas, block editor styles, and WooCommerce compatibility. Empowerment works with the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg) and popular page builders, including Elementor, Brizy, Beaver Builder, and Visual Composer. It supports translation, RTL languages, and provides customization options for colors, typography, layouts, and branding."
